            "review_title": "Review at Pho Bo Vien Thap Cam",
            "review_text": "GeorgieRowe\n10 contributions\n1\nBest Pho Bo in Ho Chi Minh city!\nJun 2018 • Couples\nWe have had our fair share of Pho Bo across Vietnam, and we tend to favour the more local flavours as opposed to a blander pho. This was absolutely delicious - we had a craving and it hit the spot. It cost just over £1 for one?! No one spoke English, but they asked if we wanted pho bo and gestured when it came to paying. It was a basic cafe style environment, but the food was unreal. We’ll be going back tomorrow!\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 27, 2018",
