            "review_text": "Samir\nMelayang, Indonesia19 contributions\n2\nLocal Pho Restaurant\nJun 2018\nVery small pho restaurant. The owners are very welcoming and extremely happy to have tourists try their pho. They do not speak any English at all. Don’t let this discourage you; they will try their best.\n\nThe pho itself is more of a Chinese style Pho than traditional Vietnamese Pho. It’s very heavy on herbs. The broth is good.\n\nTheir Saigon style ice coffee is the best I’ve ever had and I can’t it recommend enough.\nRead more\nWritten June 23, 2018",
