            "review_title": "Review at Pho Bo Vien Thap Cam",
            "review_text": "Oliver Pnuts\nFrankfurt, Germany45 contributions\n1\nLooking for the real deal - here is where you should go!\nMay 2018 • Solo\nHaving an original Pho experience is not always easy. So I looked for advices and suggestions of the locals and thats how I found this place. It a tiny Pho street kitchen. The place is usually crowded and hot. No one speaks any english as far as \"Hello\". You will get a delicious bowl of the original Pho Bo soup along with spices and herbs for a good price. Everything is fresh and tastes excellent. So If you are looking for an original experience you might try it - I loved it!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 14, 2018",
